and let nature take its course?

488
00:19:51,035 --> 00:19:52,368
- If I may...
- Well, unfortunately,

489
00:19:52,369 --> 00:19:54,320
the only male
pacific Western bear...
- Psst!

490
00:19:54,321 --> 00:19:56,155
That we could find
was raised in captivity.

491
00:19:56,156 --> 00:19:58,188
- Excuse me.
- Never been bear raised
in captivity

492
