00:27:26,413 --> 00:27:29,380
Where are you goin'?
Call me!

657
00:27:29,383 --> 00:27:31,549
<i>And so the big day finally came</i>

658
00:27:31,550 --> 00:27:33,815
<i>and I had a feeling the fur
